## 7. Key Hyperparameters

| Hyperparameter | Stage | Values to Try | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| backbone | Stage 2 | DenseNet121, EfficientNet-B0 | Speed vs accuracy |
| learning_rate | Stage 2 | 1e-4, 3e-4, 1e-3 | Fine-tuning range |
| batch_size | Stage 2 | 16, 32, 64 | GPU memory dependent |
| temperature | Stage 3 | 0.5–2.0 grid | Calibration |
| chunk_size | Stage 4 | sentence, 3-sentence, paragraph | Retrieval granularity |
