## 8. Evaluation Metrics

**Phase 1 — Classifier**
- Per-class AUROC for all 5 findings
- Macro AUROC (headline number; target ≥ 0.70 on OpenI)
- F1 at operating threshold
- Brier score + reliability diagram

**Phase 2 — Retrieval**
- Top-3 hit rate: fraction of queries retrieving ≥1 chunk from a same-label report
- 5–10 qualitative (query → top-3 chunks) examples in `03_retrieval_eval.ipynb`

**Phase 3 — Generation**
- JSON schema validity rate on first attempt (target > 95%)
- Retry rate + escalation rate

**Phase 4 — Product**
- Median + p95 end-to-end latency for POST /predict

